$Aeon::Books["zzCentral","cntnt"] = "Welcome to the City of Central! This is the closest thing you have to civilization on this planet until you build a place of your own! In Central, there are a few necessities for peaceful living, such as the <f2>Market<f1>: located in the South East corner of Central, the <f2>Teleporter Room<f1>: located across from the Library, the <f2>Prison<f1>: the large dark pyramid, the <f2>Bank<f1>: located in the NE, and last but not least the <f2>Library<f1>: where you are now! You should read '<f2>Getting Started!<f1>' next for information on how you should get started!";